recommendation_acceptance_rate

Definition:

The percentage of steps where the creator accepted the recommended option.

Steps included:

Step 1 — Positioning
Step 2 — Community Name
Step 3 — Community Address
Step 4 — Header Line
Step 5 — Owner Profile

